{"h":"\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Geist', system-ui, sans-serif; color: #0B2A4A; background: #FFFFFF; min-width: 0; overflow: hidden\">\n\n\n<!-- hero -->\n<div style=\"position: relative; overflow: hidden; background: #E9D9BF\">\n<video autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"consolidation-poster.jpg\" style=\"position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: 70% 55%\" aria-label=\"Trucks from different suppliers unload cartons at a warehouse dock, and the mixed cartons are loaded together into one shipping container\">\n<source src=\"consolidation.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n</video>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.96) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.9) 38%, rgba(255,255,255,0.3) 64%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 78%)\"></div>\n<div style=\"position: relative; max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 120px 32px 104px\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 680px\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; background: #FFC93C; color: #0B2A4A; border-radius: 999px; padding: 7px 14px; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; letter-spacing: 0.08em; margin-bottom: 22px\">FLAGSHIP · BUYER’S CONSOLIDATION · PO MANAGEMENT</div>\n<h1 style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: clamp(52px, 6.4vw, 100px); line-height: 0.95; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0 0 24px\">Many suppliers. <span style=\"color: #0A6CC2\">One shipment.</span></h1>\n<p style=\"font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.55; color: #17436B; margin: 0 0 22px\">Buying from several factories across India? We become your team on the ground. We chase every purchase order, collect the goods from each supplier, check and consolidate them at our hub, and ship everything together in one container or one air shipment.</p>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 30px\">\n<sc-for list=\"{{chips}}\" as=\"c\" hint-placeholder-count=\"4\"><span style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #DCEAF6; border-radius: 999px; padding: 9px 14px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600\">✓ {{c}}</span></sc-for>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px\">\n<a class=\"go\" href=\"contact.html\" style=\"background: #0A6CC2; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 16px 28px; border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none\">Get a consolidation quote →</a>\n<a href=\"https://wa.me/message/6YB7I76DV6UJL1\" style=\"background: #25D366; color: #06331A; padding: 16px 26px; border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none\">WhatsApp a broker</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- who -->\n<div style=\"max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 96px 32px 40px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 40px 64px; align-items: center\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 520px; min-width: 0\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #0A6CC2; margin-bottom: 14px\">WHO IT’S FOR</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: clamp(36px, 4.2vw, 58px); line-height: 1.02; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0 0 22px\">Importers who buy from India again and again.</h2>\n<div style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; color: #3D5873; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0\">Retailers, wholesalers, brands and sourcing agents who place orders with several Indian suppliers at once: rugs from one town, brassware from another, textiles from a third. Each order alone is too small for its own container, and chasing ten factories from abroad takes weeks of emails and calls.</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; color: #0B2A4A; font-weight: 600\">We do the chasing, the collecting and the shipping. You get one weekly report, one shipment and one set of documents.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 440px; min-width: 0; border-radius: 28px; box-shadow: 0 30px 70px rgba(11,42,74,0.10)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 560 480\" width=\"100%\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Orders from five Indian suppliers converge at the YAM consolidation hub and leave together in one container\" style=\"display: block\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"560\" height=\"480\" rx=\"28\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" /><path d=\"M88,60 C190,60 210,240 270,240\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#BFE5FF\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 7\" /><rect opacity=\"0\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#C98B4B\" stroke=\"#8A5A2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" x=\"-9\" y=\"-7\"><animatemotion dur=\"4s\" begin=\"0.0s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" path=\"M88,60 C190,60 210,240 270,240\" keyPoints=\"0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0;0.8;1\" calcMode=\"linear\" /><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" dur=\"4s\" begin=\"0.0s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" values=\"1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0;0.78;0.82;1\" /></rect><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"60\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#0A6CC2\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"3\" /><text x=\"70\" y=\"44\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Archivo, sans-serif\" font-weight=\"800\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#0B2A4A\">Bhadohi</text><text x=\"70\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Geist, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5E7891\">Rugs</text><path d=\"M58,150 C160,150 210,240 270,240\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#BFE5FF\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 7\" /><rect opacity=\"0\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#C98B4B\" stroke=\"#8A5A2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" x=\"-9\" y=\"-7\"><animatemotion dur=\"4s\" begin=\"0.6s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" path=\"M58,150 C160,150 210,240 270,240\" keyPoints=\"0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0;0.8;1\" calcMode=\"linear\" /><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" dur=\"4s\" begin=\"0.6s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" values=\"1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0;0.78;0.82;1\" /></rect><circle cx=\"40\" cy=\"150\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#0A6CC2\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"3\" /><text x=\"40\" y=\"134\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Archivo, sans-serif\" font-weight=\"800\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#0B2A4A\">Moradabad</text><text x=\"40\" y=\"176\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Geist, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5E7891\">Brassware</text><path d=\"M88,240 C190,240 210,240 270,240\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#BFE5FF\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 7\" /><rect opacity=\"0\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#C98B4B\" stroke=\"#8A5A2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" x=\"-9\" y=\"-7\"><animatemotion dur=\"4s\" begin=\"1.2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" path=\"M88,240 C190,240 210,240 270,240\" keyPoints=\"0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0;0.8;1\" calcMode=\"linear\" /><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" dur=\"4s\" begin=\"1.2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" values=\"1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0;0.78;0.82;1\" /></rect><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"240\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#0A6CC2\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"3\" /><text x=\"70\" y=\"224\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Archivo, sans-serif\" font-weight=\"800\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#0B2A4A\">Jaipur</text><text x=\"70\" y=\"266\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Geist, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5E7891\">Textiles</text><path d=\"M58,330 C160,330 210,240 270,240\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#BFE5FF\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 7\" /><rect opacity=\"0\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#C98B4B\" stroke=\"#8A5A2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" x=\"-9\" y=\"-7\"><animatemotion dur=\"4s\" begin=\"1.7999999999999998s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" path=\"M58,330 C160,330 210,240 270,240\" keyPoints=\"0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0;0.8;1\" calcMode=\"linear\" /><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" dur=\"4s\" begin=\"1.7999999999999998s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" values=\"1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0;0.78;0.82;1\" /></rect><circle cx=\"40\" cy=\"330\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#0A6CC2\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"3\" /><text x=\"40\" y=\"314\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Archivo, sans-serif\" font-weight=\"800\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#0B2A4A\">Saharanpur</text><text x=\"40\" y=\"356\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Geist, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5E7891\">Woodcraft</text><path d=\"M88,420 C190,420 210,240 270,240\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#BFE5FF\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 7\" /><rect opacity=\"0\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#C98B4B\" stroke=\"#8A5A2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" x=\"-9\" y=\"-7\"><animatemotion dur=\"4s\" begin=\"2.4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" path=\"M88,420 C190,420 210,240 270,240\" keyPoints=\"0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0;0.8;1\" calcMode=\"linear\" /><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" dur=\"4s\" begin=\"2.4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" values=\"1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0;0.78;0.82;1\" /></rect><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"420\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#0A6CC2\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"3\" /><text x=\"70\" y=\"404\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Archivo, sans-serif\" font-weight=\"800\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#0B2A4A\">Tiruppur</text><text x=\"70\" y=\"446\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Geist, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5E7891\">Garments</text><rect x=\"266\" y=\"200\" width=\"96\" height=\"80\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#FFC93C\" /><text x=\"314\" y=\"234\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Archivo, sans-serif\" font-weight=\"900\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#0B2A4A\">YAM</text><text x=\"314\" y=\"254\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Geist Mono, monospace\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#0B2A4A\">HUB</text><path d=\"M362,240 H480\" stroke=\"#0A6CC2\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" /><g><animatetransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"translate\" values=\"0 0;0 -4;0 0\" dur=\"3s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" /><rect x=\"430\" y=\"205\" width=\"110\" height=\"60\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#E2483A\" /><path d=\"M445 212v46M460 212v46M475 212v46M490 212v46M505 212v46M520 212v46\" stroke=\"#B4332A\" stroke-width=\"3\" /><text x=\"485\" y=\"290\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Geist Mono, monospace\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#5E7891\">ONE CONTAINER</text></g></svg></div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- services -->\n<div style=\"max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 32px 90px\">\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(270px, 1fr)); gap: 14px\">\n<sc-for list=\"{{services}}\" as=\"c\" hint-placeholder-count=\"8\">\n<div class=\"card\" style=\"background: #F2F8FD; border-radius: 20px; padding: 26px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px\">\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; color: #0A6CC2; letter-spacing: 0.1em\">{{c.k}}</span>\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-stretch: 106%; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.1\">{{c.t}}</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: #3D5873\">{{c.b}}</span>\n</div>\n</sc-for>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- process -->\n<div style=\"background: #FFF8E6\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 100px 32px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #B45309; margin-bottom: 14px\">HOW IT WORKS</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: clamp(38px, 4.4vw, 64px); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0 0 44px\">From purchase order to one bill of lading.</h2>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 12px\">\n<sc-for list=\"{{steps}}\" as=\"s\" hint-placeholder-count=\"6\">\n<div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 20px; padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px\">\n<span style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%; background: #0A6CC2; color: #FFFFFF; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%;\">{{s.n}}</span>\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-stretch: 106%; font-size: 19px\">{{s.t}}</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; color: #4A4030\">{{s.b}}</span>\n</div>\n</sc-for>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- report -->\n<div style=\"max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 100px 32px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px 56px; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 28px\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 560px; min-width: 0\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #0A6CC2; margin-bottom: 14px\">YOUR WEEKLY PO STATUS REPORT</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: clamp(36px, 4.2vw, 58px); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0\">Every order, every supplier, one page.</h2>\n</div>\n<p style=\"flex: 1 1 360px; min-width: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #3D5873; margin: 0\">Sent every week by email or WhatsApp, with photos of the cargo as it arrives at our hub.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"overflow-x: auto; border: 1px solid #E1EDF7; border-radius: 20px\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 15px; min-width: 820px\">\n<thead><tr style=\"background: #F2F8FD; text-align: left\">\n<th style=\"padding: 14px 18px; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: #5E7891\">PO</th>\n<th style=\"padding: 14px 18px; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: #5E7891\">SUPPLIER</th>\n<th style=\"padding: 14px 18px; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: #5E7891\">GOODS</th>\n<th style=\"padding: 14px 18px; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: #5E7891\">READY DATE</th>\n<th style=\"padding: 14px 18px; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: #5E7891\">STATUS</th>\n</tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<sc-for list=\"{{report}}\" as=\"r\" hint-placeholder-count=\"6\">\n<tr style=\"border-top: 1px solid #E1EDF7\"><td style=\"padding: 14px 18px; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px\">{{r.po}}</td><td style=\"padding: 14px 18px; font-weight: 600\">{{r.s}}</td><td style=\"padding: 14px 18px; color: #3D5873\">{{r.g}}</td><td style=\"padding: 14px 18px; color: #3D5873\">{{r.d}}</td><td style=\"padding: 14px 18px\"><span style=\"{{r.style}}\">{{r.st}}</span></td></tr>\n</sc-for>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #5E7891; margin: 12px 0 0\">Sample report with illustrative suppliers.</p>\n</div>\n\n<!-- calculator -->\n<div style=\"background: #0A6CC2; color: #FFFFFF\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 100px 32px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 40px 64px; align-items: center\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 480px; min-width: 0\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #FFC93C; margin-bottom: 14px\">TRY IT</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: clamp(36px, 4.2vw, 58px); line-height: 1.02; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0 0 28px\">How many part-loads could become one container?</h2>\n<label style=\"display: block; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 8px\">Number of suppliers: <span style=\"color: #FFC93C\">{{vendors}}</span></label>\n<input type=\"range\" min=\"2\" max=\"20\" step=\"1\" value=\"{{vendors}}\" onChange=\"{{setVendors}}\" aria-label=\"Number of suppliers\">\n<label style=\"display: block; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0 8px\">Average volume per supplier: <span style=\"color: #FFC93C\">{{avg}} m³</span></label>\n<input type=\"range\" min=\"0.5\" max=\"15\" step=\"0.5\" value=\"{{avg}}\" onChange=\"{{setAvg}}\" aria-label=\"Average cubic metres per supplier\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 420px; min-width: 0; background: #FFFFFF; color: #0B2A4A; border-radius: 28px; padding: 32px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #0A6CC2; margin-bottom: 6px\">COMBINED VOLUME</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: 60px; line-height: 1\">{{total}} <span style=\"font-size: 24px\">m³</span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 14px; color: #0A6CC2\">{{fit}}</div>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px; margin-top: 22px\">\n<div style=\"background: #F2F8FD; border-radius: 16px; padding: 16px\"><div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #5E7891\">Without consolidation</div><div style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: 26px; margin-top: 4px\">{{vendors}} shipments</div></div>\n<div style=\"background: #FFF4D6; border-radius: 16px; padding: 16px\"><div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #7A5A00\">With YAM</div><div style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: 26px; margin-top: 4px\">{{boxes}}</div></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #5E7891; margin-top: 14px\">One bill of lading and one customs clearance at your end, instead of {{vendors}}. Based on practical loadable volume of about 28 / 58 / 68 m³.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- FAQ -->\n<div style=\"background: #F2F8FD\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 96px 32px\">\n<h2 style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: clamp(36px, 4.2vw, 56px); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0 0 32px\">Consolidation questions</h2>\n<sc-for list=\"{{faqs}}\" as=\"q\" hint-placeholder-count=\"6\">\n<details style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; padding: 20px 24px; margin-bottom: 10px\">\n<summary style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 18px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px\">{{q.q}}<span style=\"color: #0A6CC2\">+</span></summary>\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; color: #3D5873; margin: 12px 0 0\">{{q.a}}</p>\n</details>\n</sc-for>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: #FFC93C; color: #0B2A4A\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 80px 32px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 32px; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between\">\n<h2 style=\"flex: 1 1 600px; min-width: 0; font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: clamp(38px, 4.8vw, 68px); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0\">Send us your open purchase orders. <span style=\"color: #0A6CC2\">We’ll take it from here.</span></h2>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px\">\n<a class=\"go\" href=\"contact.html\" style=\"background: #0A6CC2; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 18px 30px; border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none\">Get a consolidation quote →</a>\n<a href=\"https://wa.me/message/6YB7I76DV6UJL1\" style=\"background: #25D366; color: #06331A; padding: 18px 28px; border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none\">WhatsApp a broker</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n"}